ger technical but poor crew. B has stress but poor communication. A has leadership but poor openness.\n\nThus I might vote for Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: Agent 1 recommended D, Agent 3 recommended C. I can say I align with Agent 3, supporting C, and explain why.\n\nWe need to include explicit facts: \"C keeps calm in a crisis\", \"C makes correct decisions quickly\", \"C puts concern for others above everything\", \"C has excellent attention skills\". Also note concerns: \"C has difficulty communicating ideas\" and \"C is not very willing to further his education\". Then argue that despite communication issues, his crew-oriented mindset and attention outweigh.\n\nThus vote C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
